---
import ContentLayout from '@layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '@config/site';
import { STATS } from '@data/calculators';
---

<ContentLayout
  title="About AllCalculators"
  description="Learn about AllCalculators — our mission to build the fastest, most accurate and most trustworthy free online calculators."
  path="/about"
  heading="About AllCalculators"
>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} exists to answer everyday number questions quickly, accurately and
    without friction. Whether you are working out a mortgage payment, checking your
    BMI or solving a maths problem, you should be able to get a reliable answer in
    seconds — free, private, and with no sign-up.
  </p>

  <h2>Our mission</h2>
  <p>
    We are building one of the web's most trustworthy calculator libraries: currently
    {STATS.live} live tools across {STATS.categories} categories, with new ones added
    regularly. Every tool is designed to be genuinely useful, not just to rank — fast
    to load, easy to use, and correct.
  </p>

  <h2>What makes us different</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Accuracy first.</strong> The maths behind each calculator is unit-tested and reviewed against authoritative sources.</li>
    <li><strong>Privacy by default.</strong> Calculations run in your browser; we do not collect the values you enter.</li>
    <li><strong>Speed.</strong> Our pages are static and lightweight, so they load fast on any connection or device.</li>
    <li><strong>Clarity.</strong> Each tool explains how it works, so you can understand the result — not just copy it.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we're funded</h2>
  <p>
    To keep {SITE.name} free, we may display advertising in the future. When we do, it
    will be limited and unobtrusive — we will never let ads compromise the speed,
    accuracy or usability of the tools. Advertising never influences the results a
    calculator produces.
  </p>

  <h2>Get in touch</h2>
  <p>
    Have a correction, a feature request or a calculator you'd like us to build? We
    read everything — visit our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>. To understand our
    quality process, see <a href="/methodology">how we build calculators</a>.
  </p>
</ContentLayout>
